# Pairs with RNoStrandedPrepare. A receiver leaf stages a prepare that arrives
# after it has already applied the saga's terminal - a duplicate redelivered
# because its ack was lost - instead of refusing it as
# BPlusLeafGrain.IsLatePrepareForTerminalTransaction does. Each saga issues one
# terminal per source shard and the leaf has already consumed it, so the bucket
# is never drained.
MODULE: RNoStrandedPrepareLatePrepareStaged
TARGET: RNoStrandedPrepare
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a receiver leaf stages a duplicate prepare that trails the saga's terminal
PERTURBS: DeliverPrepare

--- FIND
    /\ rpend' = IF rterm[m.key] = "none" THEN [rpend EXCEPT ![m.key] = "pending"] ELSE rpend
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no late-prepare refusal.
    /\ rpend' = [rpend EXCEPT ![m.key] = "pending"]
--- END
